  "remarks": "JSC Bank Russian Standard is a leading private Russian bank. It conducts banking operations as well as securities management, depository, dealer and brokerage activities. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Bank Russian Standard is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
